&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability&amp;nbsp;to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Based in the Washington, DC area (Rosslyn, VA), with&amp;nbsp;regular&amp;nbsp;travel to K2 Space headquarters in Torrance, California,&amp;nbsp;and other locations as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
