&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;K2 Space is building the largest, highest-power satellites ever flown, and we’re hiring our first EH&amp;amp;S Leader to build the safety program from the ground up. You’ll design and lead EH&amp;amp;S strategy, compliance, and day-to-day execution across our manufacturing floor, cleanrooms, and labs. Reporting to the VP of Manufacturing, you’ll partner closely with Manufacturing, Facilities, and Engineering leadership to build safety programs that keep pace with a fast-growing hardware company. We’re scaling from early production to building satellites at rate, and the EH&amp;amp;S programs we need tomorrow don’t exist yet. You’ll build the safety program that protects our people and enables us to scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
