&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Compensation will be based on several factors including, but not limited&amp;nbsp;to:&amp;nbsp;knowledge and skills, education, and experience level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
