&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience with mechanical and/or electromechanical design and analysis in solar or electro-mechanical systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
