&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Direct experience leading solar array engineering for space applications, spanning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; design, module interconnect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, module lamination, integrated PVA construction, and flight array integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
