&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manufacturing is a major emphasis of this role. For any in-house fabrication and assembly,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;the evaluation and&amp;nbsp;selection&amp;nbsp;of manufacturing equipment and working with the production team to develop a factory layout, work instructions, in-process checkouts, and end-of-line tests to ensure successful builds.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
