&lt;p&gt;You will lead the month-end close process and other business processes such as fixed assets, inventory, and revenue and receivables. This role involves working with team members across the organization, enhancing controls throughout business processes, maintaining compliance with company policies and financial regulations, and identifying opportunities to further improve business processes. The ideal candidate is detail-oriented, self-starter, and skilled in leadership and process improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;esponsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the month-end close process to ensure complete, accurate, and timely reporting and accelerating the month-end close timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare journal entries, accruals, and account reconciliations across fixed assets, inventory, and revenue &amp;amp; receivables processes and ensure retention of supporting documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an accounting resource for operational and technical matters, clearly communicating requirements to non-finance partners&lt;/li&gt;
