&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with chip-package co-design or advanced packaging (2.5D/3D).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with physical design service vendor management or offshore collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
