&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with Gate-All-Around technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working in cross-functional, geographically distributed teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
