&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;be at the heart&amp;nbsp;of bringing&amp;nbsp;the production system&amp;nbsp;to life.&amp;nbsp;K2 has a strong push to vertically integrate our production system, which means&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;work side-by-side with the production and engineering team to concept, develop, and roll out various automation projects to support&amp;nbsp;this vision.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
