&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own the success of component, subsystem, and vehicle level testing across structural, thermal, fluid, dynamic, and electromechanical systems. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will lead projects and help stand-up infrastructure to support the core testing infrastructure. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In your first 6 months, you will define development test campaigns, design and build test setups, and be hands-on with flight hardware. In your first year, you will validate designs through prototype testing and lead large multidisciplinary test campaigns. You will drive best practices by leading large test campaigns and mentoring the growing team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
