&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with internal and external stakeholders to integrate your designs into the spacecraft systems and operate your hardware in flight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop test equipment, development PCBAs, and test scripts to assist with all of the above&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
