&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;design-for-excellence&amp;nbsp;reviews with&amp;nbsp;design engineers across PCBs, PCBAs, machined components, and assemblies for&amp;nbsp;initial&amp;nbsp;design, flight hardware, and tooling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the development of&amp;nbsp;innovative manufacturing systems for&amp;nbsp;spacecraft&amp;nbsp;electronic&amp;nbsp;assemblies, including&amp;nbsp;electromechanical sub-assemblies,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;harnessing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
