&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mentor and&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;technical guidance to junior&amp;nbsp;Manufacturing Engineers, technicians,&amp;nbsp;and design peers on electronics manufacturing best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
