&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of launch vehicles, spacecraft, or other aerospace systems&amp;nbsp;and their certification and/or verification processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
