&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with RF/mmWave&amp;nbsp;characterization and equipment such as VNAs, spectrum analyzers, signal generators, power meters, and load-pull systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
