&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1289&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c26c044d0f1&quot;&gt;Develop mission-level modeling and simulation of national security space missions, capturing operational objectives, environments, and constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1440&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9aed365a3a52&quot;&gt;Model and analyze constellation-level capability and performance against mission requirements, including network coverage, beam planning, and resilience in contested environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1623&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa1aba0f0f5b&quot;&gt;Support work on classified programs in accordance with all applicable security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1719&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b302bcb076e2&quot;&gt;Create and maintain simulation software infrastructure for our 20kW+ spacecraft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1803&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f9a70e681ae&quot;&gt;Develop physics-based software models of spacecraft subsystems, including propulsion, attitude control, power, and communications systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1cc2b30fd920&quot;&gt;Create and utilize robust tools to allow for rapid deployment of quality code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9d00f8c9172b&quot;&gt;Perform data analysis and anomaly investigation to identify and resolve on-orbit problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2121&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3012e09df5e0&quot;&gt;Support integration and testing of spacecraft subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2182&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9d0e80748c39&quot;&gt;Set technical direction, review designs and code, and mentor junior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
