&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in mechanical, aerospace, or other relevant engineering discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
