&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to personally design, build, and test hardware from a blank canvas, including troubleshooting and iterating designs based on downstream feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
