&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in MS Office suite, and shop floor management software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate high level of ownership and problem-solving abilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to set up and use a torque wrench and other hand tools such as: wrenches and safety wire pliers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing crimping, wire stripping, continuity testing, connector pin outs, routing, and tie wrapping&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using test and measuring tools (digital multimeter, caliper, micrometer)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with ERP and part traceability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
