&lt;li&gt;Hand soldering ability and PCB rework experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, review, and redline electrical schematics and mechanical drawings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with various potting and encapsulation techniques for cables and enclosures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
