&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Must be able to lift and carry parts or equipment up to 50 lbs. unassisted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Must be able to stand for extended periods of time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Must be able to work extended hours and/or weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
