&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hourly pay range for this non-exempt role is $24– $35 + equity in the company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation will be based on several factors including, but not limited to: knowledge and skills, education, and experience level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefits package including paid time off, medical/dental/vision coverage, life insurance, paid parental leave, and many other perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the preferred skills and experience, we encourage you to still apply! Building a spacecraft unlike any other requires a team unlike any other and non-traditional career twists and turns are encouraged!&lt;/p&gt;
